{"id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-kripke-frame.md","title":"Kripke Frame","display":"df-kripke-frame — Kripke Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-kripke-frame","aliases":["89-df-kripke-frame"],"display":"df-kripke-frame — Kripke Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-world]]","[[89-df-accessibility]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-kripke-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-kripke-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kripke-frame — Kripke Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-kripke-frame-—-Kripke-Frame-$\\mathcal{F}$\">df-kripke-frame — Kripke Frame <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"edcd1eb132936613\" href=\"?note=edcd1eb132936613\" title=\"89-df-world\">89-df-world</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R \\subseteq W \\times W\">\\(R \\subseteq W \\times W\\)</span> (accessibility relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(W\\ne\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq W\\times W),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{F}_{W,R}\\coloneqq(W,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(W\\ne\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq W\\times W),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal{F}_{W,R}\\coloneqq(W,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_{W,R}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_{W,R}\\)</span> : 由满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> 的数据组成的\nKripke 框架</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> : 可能世界集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : 可达关系（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRv\">\\(wRv\\)</span>表示从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>可达<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>框架决定模态逻辑的语义基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-kripke-frame-—-Kripke-Frame-$\\mathcal{F}$","text":"df-kripke-frame — Kripke Frame $\\mathcal{F}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-world]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-accessibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-world","status":"resolved","id":"edcd1eb132936613","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnc